541
00:56:24.840 --> 00:56:28.799
I was gonna deal with him,
but he climbed into the crawlspace.

542
00:56:29.640 --> 00:56:30.709
That was him in my room.

543
00:56:30.840 --> 00:56:31.955
Uh-huh.

544
00:56:32.800 --> 00:56:34.472
Yeah, I thought
it was all over.

545
