Please.
Open.

556
00:57:16.000 --> 00:57:17.228
No, no...

557
00:57:17.360 --> 00:57:18.360
Ow!

558
00:57:20.120 --> 00:57:21.439
Stop it! Stop it!
Stop it!

559
00:57:24.840 --> 00:57:26.159
Swallow.

560
00:57:28.200 --> 00:57:29.394
Swallow.

561
