Wait! Stop!

688
01:17:42.200 --> 01:17:43.918
I didn't know.

689
01:17:44.000 --> 01:17:47.629
I didn't understand
that you were doing it for us.

690
01:17:47.720 --> 01:17:48.869
I didn't know.

691
01:17:49.600 --> 01:17:51.238
