712
01:19:18.080 --> 01:19:21.072
Okay, let's go.
Let's go. Quick.

713
01:19:26.320 --> 01:19:27.548
Let's go.

714
01:20:00.080 --> 01:20:01.080
Tom!

715
01:20:05.880 --> 01:20:06.880
